WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.560
<v 0>Now so far what we have done is connect pre-existing applications to Cloud Code</v>

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.460
so that we can automate those tools Now the real power behind these agents

3
00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.580
is that they can actually create applications on your behalf as well So if

4
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.700
you now need a Chrome extension or a custom software for your business,

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.140
you can actually ask these agents to do that for you So in the

6
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.720
following optional lessons I'll show you exactly what that build process looks like as

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:27.620
well as a view of rubric which we use internally to provide a more

8
00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.060
visual layer of working with these agents And the great thing about building your

9
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:35.320
own applications is that you also control the connection between Cloud Code and that

10
00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:40.160
application, which is usually much easier versus having to rely on other third-party

11
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:40.400
tools.
